baseline sanity check that things are working and relies only an assumption \
of the radius of the earth.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.571685562888769*^9, 3.571685585378147*^9}, {
  3.575484739681086*^9, 
  3.575484827801392*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"84678d63-2567-4cb1-97fa-\
