Cell["\<\
Now do the more complex compuation where we use the WGS84 parameterization of \
Earth.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5716856293634357`*^9, 3.5716856445163307`*^9}, {
  3.571687642986508*^9, 
  3.5716876688720407`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e1344bf4-932e-46d9-8e98-\
